id: mind-read
name: Mind Read
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Mind Reading's mark, on the one read, clocked to the end of the reader's next turn - Analyzed's
# shape. What it gives the reader is read where their Dodge and Parry are made (chat.mjs mindReadBonus).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Read by Mind Reading: its reader's Dodge and Parry against you 1(T) higher until the end of their next turn.
text: >
  Mind Read: Mind Reading's mark - "increase your Dodge Rolls and the Dice Score of any Strike Roll made through the Parry
  effect of the Defend Maneuver against that Opponent by 1(T) until the end of your next turn."
